1
00:00:05,841 --> 00:00:07,366
(All characters, organizations,
and events in this drama are fictitious.)

2
00:00:07,391 --> 00:00:09,055
(Filming complied with guidelines
for children, youth, and animals.)

3
00:00:12,934 --> 00:00:14,600
Wait a moment.

4
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:16,920
There?

5
00:00:33,518 --> 00:00:37,432
(One year later)

6
00:00:37,462 --> 00:00:39,427
Gyu Rim is dating someone.

7
00:00:44,848 --> 00:00:45,923
Mu Jin.

8
00:00:48,291 --> 00:00:49,702
I missed you.

9
00:00:49,822 --> 00:00:50,855
Me too.

10
00:00:51,792 --> 00:00:52,972
Did you wait long?

11
00:00:53,776 --> 00:00:58,227
We were worried Mu Jin
would take our sister away from us.

12
00:00:58,332 --> 00:01:00,189
- What did you stick on me?
- Nothing.

13
00:01:00,395 --> 00:01:02,816
What is it? You did it again!

14
00:01:02,871 --> 00:01:04,598
- No! Don't take it off!
- You did, didn't you?

15
00:01:06,416 --> 00:01:07,515
Seriously!

16
00:01:08,088 --> 00:01:09,730
- There's one more.
- One more?

17
00:01:09,785 --> 00:01:11,107
- Yeah.
- Where is it?

18
00:01:19,953 --> 00:01:21,284
Hi.

19
00:01:23,663 --> 00:01:25,021
Did you study hard?

20
00:01:26,202 --> 00:01:28,471
- Aren't you hungry?
- But Mu Jin,

21
00:01:28,623 --> 00:01:30,547
told us this.

22
00:01:31,617 --> 00:01:34,086
- Gyu Rim.
- Gyu Min.

23
00:01:34,111 --> 00:01:35,664
- Hey, you're here.
- Gyu Rim!

24
00:01:36,021 --> 00:01:37,343
You started already?

25
00:01:38,623 --> 00:01:40,774
- What do you want to eat?
- Black bean noodles for me too.

26
00:01:41,348 --> 00:01:42,871
One more black bean noodles, please.

27
00:01:51,743 --> 00:01:55,532
I'm not taking your sister away from you.

28
00:01:57,536 --> 00:01:59,255
I'm joining your family,

29
00:01:59,398 --> 00:02:02,588
as a big brother to both of you.

30
00:02:02,631 --> 00:02:03,848
So cute.

31
00:02:05,309 --> 00:02:09,974
So we decided to trust him.

32
00:02:09,999 --> 00:02:11,120
(Episode 3)

33
00:02:11,145 --> 00:02:12,704
Dad.

34
00:02:15,668 --> 00:02:16,921
Good evening, sir.

35
00:02:18,526 --> 00:02:20,948
Who might this be?

36
00:02:23,132 --> 00:02:24,471
My name is Kim Mu Jin.

37
00:02:24,539 --> 00:02:26,471
He's Gyu Rim's boyfriend.

38
00:02:28,088 --> 00:02:29,351
Boyfriend?

39
00:02:31,246 --> 00:02:34,195
Gyu Rim, you're dating someone?

40
00:02:35,448 --> 00:02:38,627
You two go wash up first. Go on.

41
00:02:39,258 --> 00:02:41,959
- Goodbye.
- Thanks for the black bean noodles.

42
00:02:41,984 --> 00:02:43,919
Sure. Let's do it again sometime.

43
00:02:56,841 --> 00:02:57,974
Dad.

44
00:03:11,648 --> 00:03:14,404
Good-looking, too.

45
00:03:16,628 --> 00:03:17,795
My Gyu Rim,

46
00:03:18,302 --> 00:03:20,295
landed herself a real catch.

47
00:03:22,354 --> 00:03:25,358
- Thank you.
- With a boyfriend this fine,

48
00:03:25,448 --> 00:03:28,020
you should've introduced him to me first.

49
00:03:29,788 --> 00:03:32,680
So, how long have you two been together?

50
00:03:33,455 --> 00:03:35,531
It's been about a year now.

51
00:03:36,728 --> 00:03:38,601
I'm sorry I didn't come to you sooner.

52
00:03:38,950 --> 00:03:40,768
A year?

53
00:03:42,134 --> 00:03:44,954
If it's been a whole year...

54
00:03:45,590 --> 00:03:48,033
then you must be thinking
about marriage too.

55
00:03:48,058 --> 00:03:50,235
- It's not like that.
- It is, sir.

56
00:03:50,510 --> 00:03:52,267
- Mu Jin.
- If you'll give us your blessing,

57
00:03:52,354 --> 00:03:55,112
I'd like to marry Gyu Rim.

58
00:03:58,143 --> 00:04:01,312
I like a man who speaks his mind, Mu Jin.

59
00:04:03,225 --> 00:04:05,364
Then let's set a date this year.

60
00:04:06,518 --> 00:04:07,758
That works for me.

61
00:04:08,398 --> 00:04:09,747
It's not like that.

62
00:04:09,788 --> 00:04:11,176
Not yet, Dad.

63
00:04:11,358 --> 00:04:13,721
We both need to work more
and earn more first.

64
00:04:14,114 --> 00:04:15,856
Earn what?

65
00:04:16,021 --> 00:04:18,379
Mu Jin is rich.

66
00:04:20,288 --> 00:04:21,907
He's not rich.

67
00:04:21,932 --> 00:04:24,696
He works part-time at the same place I do.

68
00:04:25,494 --> 00:04:28,559
Why would a man wearing a watch
that costs a fortune work part-time?

69
00:04:31,021 --> 00:04:34,855
Is it that thing rich heirs do,

70
00:04:35,121 --> 00:04:37,136
hiding who they are to learn the business?

71
00:04:37,508 --> 00:04:39,038
I told you it's not like that.

72
00:04:39,085 --> 00:04:41,783
And no watch on earth
costs that kind of money.

73
00:04:42,308 --> 00:04:44,864
Did you tell Gyu Rim you were broke?

74
00:04:45,260 --> 00:04:49,461
What, so she wouldn't feel
inferior and get scared off?

75
00:04:49,801 --> 00:04:52,573
Dad, you've got it all wrong.

76
00:04:52,598 --> 00:04:57,514
So considerate of him.

77
00:04:58,245 --> 00:04:59,485
Well, the thing is...

78
00:04:59,510 --> 00:05:01,496
I'm telling you, it's not like that.

79
00:05:03,563 --> 00:05:04,963
It's a knockoff.

80
00:05:11,218 --> 00:05:13,021
- A knockoff?
- Yes.

81
00:05:14,442 --> 00:05:16,415
I bought it at Namdaemun Market.

82
00:05:18,726 --> 00:05:19,738
Then...

83
00:05:20,502 --> 00:05:25,770
the belt and shoes are fakes too?

84
00:05:28,300 --> 00:05:29,494
Yes.

85
00:05:30,410 --> 00:05:31,622
And you're not an heir?

86
00:05:33,302 --> 00:05:34,510
No.

87
00:05:34,682 --> 00:05:35,886
Not rich either?

88
00:05:37,568 --> 00:05:40,274
He works hard just like me,

89
00:05:40,518 --> 00:05:42,486
and makes an honest living.
That's who Mu Jin is.

90
00:05:42,511 --> 00:05:44,327
Why are you dating a guy like this?

91
00:05:45,222 --> 00:05:47,402
So the two of you can starve together?

92
00:05:47,482 --> 00:05:50,402
- Dad!
- Of course.

93
00:05:50,530 --> 00:05:53,277
That's your taste in men.

94
00:05:53,588 --> 00:05:56,170
- Break up with him while I'm being nice.
- Dad.

95
00:05:56,227 --> 00:05:59,395
Hardworking and honest, my foot.

96
00:05:59,602 --> 00:06:01,614
I know guys like this, all right?

97
00:06:01,871 --> 00:06:05,391
A young man with nothing,
already chasing designer labels.

98
00:06:06,123 --> 00:06:09,741
If you can't afford it, let it go,

99
00:06:09,893 --> 00:06:11,617
and learn to live within your means.

100
00:06:11,948 --> 00:06:13,458
But you know, looking at it earlier...

101
00:06:14,945 --> 00:06:19,306
even as a fake, this one's top grade.

102
00:06:20,421 --> 00:06:24,327
Even fakes like this one
sell for a fortune.

103
00:06:24,706 --> 00:06:26,222
That expensive...

104
00:06:27,008 --> 00:06:29,416
Who are you trying to fool
with a high-end fake watch?

105
00:06:30,146 --> 00:06:32,766
Who are you looking to fleece?

106
00:06:32,808 --> 00:06:34,902
- Dad!
- You've got me wrong, sir.

107
00:06:34,946 --> 00:06:37,018
- Gyu Rim is all I have...
- Enough!

108
00:06:38,442 --> 00:06:40,055
Get out. Go on.

109
00:06:40,328 --> 00:06:42,220
Get away from my daughter. Now.

110
00:06:42,245 --> 00:06:44,154
Dad, what is wrong with you?

111
00:06:44,230 --> 00:06:47,021
Can't you tell just by looking at me?

112
00:06:47,238 --> 00:06:50,638
He's me in my younger days.

113
00:06:50,948 --> 00:06:53,455
Your mother picked the wrong man,

114
00:06:53,502 --> 00:06:56,363
and it ruined her life.
Haven't you learned?

115
00:06:58,088 --> 00:06:59,382
Mu Jin is different.

116
00:06:59,468 --> 00:07:01,955
At least he's not the kind of man
who lies to his wife,

117
00:07:02,174 --> 00:07:04,738
and deceives her, as you did.

118
00:07:07,028 --> 00:07:08,386
You. Come here.

119
00:07:08,834 --> 00:07:11,592
Don't hide behind a woman like a coward.

120
00:07:11,617 --> 00:07:13,709
Get over here.

121
00:07:14,228 --> 00:07:15,462
A guy like this,

122
00:07:15,538 --> 00:07:18,318
needs to be taught a lesson.
Then he'll stay away for good.

123
00:07:18,798 --> 00:07:21,698
You're getting one today.

124
00:07:22,274 --> 00:07:23,678
Come here. Hey.

125
00:07:23,861 --> 00:07:25,063
Dad!

126
00:07:25,914 --> 00:07:27,890
You lay one finger on Mu Jin,

127
00:07:27,915 --> 00:07:30,465
and I won't let it go, father or not.

128
00:07:30,490 --> 00:07:32,930
Han Gyu Rim. Move.

129
00:07:33,581 --> 00:07:34,694
Are you moving or not?

130
00:07:35,348 --> 00:07:37,473
You little! Get over here.

131
00:07:37,498 --> 00:07:40,920
- Hey.
- Mu Jin, go. I'll call you.

132
00:07:40,945 --> 00:07:43,606
Hey, get over here.

133
00:07:43,688 --> 00:07:44,828
- Go.
- I'll be going, sir.

134
00:07:44,888 --> 00:07:48,394
- Going where!
- Dad, please. Stop.

135
00:07:49,336 --> 00:07:51,147
Unbelievable!

136
00:07:51,390 --> 00:07:52,736
Get inside.

137
00:07:52,814 --> 00:07:54,556
Dad, please!

138
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,956
Taking his side already?

139
00:07:57,172 --> 00:07:59,168
And what will you do if I don't stop?

140
00:07:59,314 --> 00:08:01,697
Hit me? Go ahead.

141
00:08:02,088 --> 00:08:03,921
Han Gyu Yeong! Han Gyu O!

142
00:08:04,670 --> 00:08:07,627
Your sister is naive
and doesn't know a thing.

143
00:08:07,748 --> 00:08:10,155
She's been seeing a lowlife like that,

144
00:08:10,234 --> 00:08:11,834
and you never stopped her?

145
00:08:13,628 --> 00:08:14,918
Let go and let's talk.

146
00:08:14,943 --> 00:08:16,461
You're the one holding on, Dad.

147
00:08:18,739 --> 00:08:20,021
My shoulder...

148
00:08:21,198 --> 00:08:22,274
Hey, Han Gyu Yeong.

149
00:08:22,728 --> 00:08:24,786
You're a good judge of men.

150
00:08:25,028 --> 00:08:26,496
What were you doing?

151
00:08:26,521 --> 00:08:28,310
And what were you doing, Dad?

152
00:08:28,736 --> 00:08:31,478
If you hate it so much, you should've
come home and stopped her yourself.

153
00:08:31,798 --> 00:08:34,638
She'd lost her head over love.
How could I have stopped her?

154
00:08:34,696 --> 00:08:37,021
Han Gyu Yeong, Dad.

155
00:08:37,223 --> 00:08:38,288
That's enough.

156
00:08:38,401 --> 00:08:40,178
I told you from the start
I was against it.

157
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:43,738
You're good at throwing people out,
Dad. You threw Mom out too.

158
00:08:43,974 --> 00:08:46,865
Then do whatever it takes to stop Gyu Rim.

159
00:08:50,145 --> 00:08:51,314
Han Gyu O.

160
00:08:51,805 --> 00:08:53,488
And what were you doing, you brat?

161
00:08:54,252 --> 00:08:55,579
Me? I was rooting for her.

162
00:08:56,221 --> 00:08:58,560
I was hoping things would work out fast,

163
00:08:58,585 --> 00:09:01,577
so she could get out
of this miserable house.

164
00:09:02,085 --> 00:09:03,263
I was rooting for her like crazy.

165
00:09:03,847 --> 00:09:06,347
- That little...
- Go for it, Han Gyu Rim.

166
00:09:06,488 --> 00:09:07,808
I'm totally on your side.

167
00:09:08,144 --> 00:09:09,449
Whoever she picks,

168
00:09:10,021 --> 00:09:11,697
he'd have to be better than Dad.

169
00:09:12,390 --> 00:09:14,821
- Why, that little... You!
- What about us?

170
00:09:16,056 --> 00:09:17,400
Why don't you ask us?

171
00:09:18,021 --> 00:09:21,223
- I'm all for it.
- I'm still on the fence.

172
00:09:21,668 --> 00:09:23,292
Then why'd you eat the black bean noodles?

173
00:09:23,318 --> 00:09:24,713
Hold it!

174
00:09:25,949 --> 00:09:28,384
Grade-schoolers don't get a vote. Got it?

175
00:09:29,303 --> 00:09:30,641
You two go to your room.

176
00:09:31,336 --> 00:09:33,460
Go on. Get inside, now.

177
00:09:38,281 --> 00:09:39,659
These two are just as bad.

178
00:09:42,127 --> 00:09:43,434
Anyway,

179
00:09:44,751 --> 00:09:48,768
I'm going on a hunger strike until
you say you'll stop seeing him,

180
00:09:49,634 --> 00:09:51,875
so break up if you want me to live,

181
00:09:52,345 --> 00:09:55,944
and keep seeing him if you want me dead.

182
00:09:56,478 --> 00:09:58,021
Happy?

183
00:10:12,834 --> 00:10:14,740
Should I have just told her the truth?

184
00:10:16,934 --> 00:10:18,186
Mu Jin is different.

185
00:10:18,326 --> 00:10:22,490
At least he's not the kind of man
who lies to his wife, as you did.

186
00:10:24,570 --> 00:10:26,021
No.

187
00:10:29,014 --> 00:10:30,835
What do I do...

188
00:10:45,762 --> 00:10:47,746
I protect my daughter.

189
00:10:48,278 --> 00:10:49,950
Hunger strike, day one.

190
00:11:07,210 --> 00:11:09,238
- Hello.
- Hello there.

191
00:11:15,862 --> 00:11:17,979
- Mu Jin.
- You're just getting off?

192
00:11:20,082 --> 00:11:21,314
Long day?

193
00:11:21,794 --> 00:11:23,707
What brings you here at this time?

194
00:11:24,068 --> 00:11:26,288
I figured I'd catch you if I came by now.

195
00:11:28,268 --> 00:11:29,648
Can you spare me some time?

196
00:11:29,770 --> 00:11:31,738
- Right now?
- Yeah, right now.

197
00:11:32,098 --> 00:11:35,222
Three hours, to be safe.

198
00:11:36,268 --> 00:11:37,532
Three whole hours?

199
00:11:37,635 --> 00:11:42,128
Gyu Yeong or Gyu O can feed the kids
and get them off to school.

200
00:11:42,662 --> 00:11:44,934
What is it? Something urgent?

201
00:11:45,194 --> 00:11:46,922
Yeah, it's urgent.

202
00:11:47,415 --> 00:11:48,683
Something important?

203
00:11:49,688 --> 00:11:51,728
Yes, it's important.

204
00:11:54,046 --> 00:11:56,293
I wonder if anything's open at this hour.

205
00:12:31,722 --> 00:12:33,493
What's with this fancy car?

206
00:12:33,790 --> 00:12:35,754
It doesn't look like Jeong Woo's either.

207
00:12:50,288 --> 00:12:51,832
Where are we going?

208
00:12:56,048 --> 00:12:57,313
To see my father.

209
00:12:58,074 --> 00:12:59,154
What?

210
00:13:00,188 --> 00:13:02,021
I met your father just yesterday.

211
00:13:02,528 --> 00:13:05,096
I want my father to see you too.

212
00:13:07,086 --> 00:13:08,668
So suddenly?

213
00:13:08,898 --> 00:13:10,374
Out of nowhere like this?

214
00:13:10,868 --> 00:13:12,710
Was I given any time to prepare?

215
00:13:13,590 --> 00:13:15,021
Still, this is too much...

216
00:13:17,110 --> 00:13:18,194
Looking like this?

217
00:13:18,788 --> 00:13:20,488
I'm a complete mess right now...

218
00:13:21,021 --> 00:13:23,410
I haven't washed my hair or my face,

219
00:13:24,494 --> 00:13:26,242
and I'm in sweats.

220
00:13:26,450 --> 00:13:27,822
You're pretty without washing up,

221
00:13:28,434 --> 00:13:29,855
and you're plenty pretty right now,

222
00:13:30,870 --> 00:13:34,166
but I brought clothes just in case.
Shoes too.

223
00:13:37,628 --> 00:13:40,028
Want to change at the rest stop?

224
00:13:42,182 --> 00:13:44,255
You even brought clothes?

225
00:13:44,301 --> 00:13:48,779
Yeah. I wanted him
to meet you as soon as possible.

226
00:13:52,328 --> 00:13:54,113
Still, this isn't right.

227
00:13:54,654 --> 00:13:55,814
I'm sorry.

228
00:13:56,686 --> 00:13:59,513
I'm truly sorry, but just this once,

229
00:13:59,790 --> 00:14:01,370
please do it my way, Gyu Rim.

230
00:14:09,438 --> 00:14:13,021
(Gohyang Rest Stop)

231
00:15:20,483 --> 00:15:21,611
You look beautiful.

232
00:15:23,951 --> 00:15:25,019
It suits you.

233
00:15:27,575 --> 00:15:31,768
You asked me so earnestly
that I'm going along with it,

234
00:15:32,714 --> 00:15:34,498
but I have no idea what this is about.

235
00:15:35,408 --> 00:15:36,521
Thank you.

236
00:15:37,750 --> 00:15:39,094
Thank you so much, Gyu Rim.

237
00:15:42,066 --> 00:15:43,088
Let's go.

238
00:16:05,021 --> 00:16:06,494
Hello, sir.

239
00:16:07,381 --> 00:16:09,369
I'm Han Gyu Rim.

240
00:16:10,718 --> 00:16:14,233
If I'd known I'd be meeting you like this,
I'd have brought flowers.

241
00:16:15,021 --> 00:16:16,663
I'm sorry.

242
00:16:22,715 --> 00:16:24,265
Dad, this is my girlfriend.

243
00:16:25,065 --> 00:16:27,287
And the woman I love very much.

244
00:16:27,734 --> 00:16:30,274
I want to marry her.

245
00:16:37,130 --> 00:16:40,005
But I lied to her.

246
00:16:41,665 --> 00:16:44,077
I never meant to hide the truth
from her for so long,

247
00:16:44,626 --> 00:16:46,561
and I tried to tell her again and again,

248
00:16:48,139 --> 00:16:51,495
but I was afraid she'd
be shocked and run away.

249
00:16:54,276 --> 00:16:55,578
Young Master!

250
00:16:57,067 --> 00:16:59,807
You should've let me know you were coming.

251
00:16:59,832 --> 00:17:02,139
We're in the middle
of something important.

252
00:17:02,426 --> 00:17:03,555
Sorry?

253
00:17:04,168 --> 00:17:05,716
Right.

254
00:17:06,118 --> 00:17:08,221
Then I'll be down below,

255
00:17:08,478 --> 00:17:10,868
so just let me know if you need anything.

256
00:17:10,871 --> 00:17:12,018
All right.

257
00:17:26,048 --> 00:17:27,388
That watch yesterday,

258
00:17:29,074 --> 00:17:30,394
it wasn't a knockoff, was it?

259
00:17:33,326 --> 00:17:35,142
That very expensive car we came in,

260
00:17:36,368 --> 00:17:37,806
that's yours, isn't it?

261
00:17:40,214 --> 00:17:42,622
And these clothes I'm wearing
cost a fortune too, right?

262
00:17:45,607 --> 00:17:46,829
Mu Jin,

263
00:17:49,213 --> 00:17:51,119
you're not just a part-timer, are you?

264
00:17:55,559 --> 00:17:56,874
Was my dad right after all?

265
00:17:56,899 --> 00:17:59,208
Were you getting management training
at that restaurant?

266
00:18:01,118 --> 00:18:02,266
Yes.

267
00:18:04,107 --> 00:18:05,914
I tried to tell you again and again,

268
00:18:07,253 --> 00:18:08,761
but I was afraid it'd be too much for you.

269
00:18:09,428 --> 00:18:11,238
That you'd be angry I deceived you.

270
00:18:13,004 --> 00:18:14,144
And that,

271
00:18:16,088 --> 00:18:18,388
you'd be disappointed and leave,

272
00:18:18,586 --> 00:18:19,866
so I couldn't bring myself to tell you.

273
00:18:21,622 --> 00:18:22,830
I'm sorry.

274
00:18:25,748 --> 00:18:27,055
I'm sorry, Gyu Rim.

275
00:18:28,318 --> 00:18:29,650
I'm so sorry for lying to you.

276
00:18:33,603 --> 00:18:34,688
Gyu Rim,

277
00:18:36,782 --> 00:18:38,090
say something. Anything.

278
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:45,040
Let me think about it.

279
00:18:48,354 --> 00:18:51,250
- Gyu Rim.
- Just let me think!

280
00:18:53,607 --> 00:18:55,947
About what I'm supposed to do with this.

281
00:18:57,668 --> 00:18:59,230
My boyfriend's an heir.

282
00:19:00,054 --> 00:19:01,464
I've hit the jackpot.

283
00:19:03,007 --> 00:19:05,162
Should I be happy about it?

284
00:19:06,921 --> 00:19:09,689
or furious at myself,

285
00:19:09,869 --> 00:19:12,440
for being fooled like a complete idiot.

286
00:19:13,094 --> 00:19:15,361
Should I be embarrassed
for comforting you,

287
00:19:16,829 --> 00:19:20,607
without even knowing you were an heir
in management training.

288
00:19:22,074 --> 00:19:23,638
Or is this just wrong?

289
00:19:25,198 --> 00:19:27,920
Maybe this was always out of my reach.

290
00:19:28,235 --> 00:19:31,661
Should I end things with Kim Mu Jin?

291
00:19:33,908 --> 00:19:35,708
Let me think about it.

292
00:20:06,674 --> 00:20:08,566
Ma'am, we've arrived.

293
00:20:12,174 --> 00:20:13,776
- Ma'am?
- Yes?

294
00:20:14,802 --> 00:20:16,790
Right, I'm sorry.

295
00:20:33,074 --> 00:20:34,292
Gyu Rim.

296
00:20:38,694 --> 00:20:39,904
Something wrong?

297
00:20:40,887 --> 00:20:44,570
No. Did Gyu Min and Gyu Seo
leave for school?

298
00:20:45,068 --> 00:20:47,348
Gyu Seo forgot her bag,
so I ran it over to her.

299
00:20:47,984 --> 00:20:49,508
Thanks for that. Let's go in.

300
00:20:49,554 --> 00:20:50,871
What I said yesterday,

301
00:20:52,927 --> 00:20:53,984
I meant it.

302
00:20:56,488 --> 00:20:58,182
I want you to get married soon,

303
00:20:58,207 --> 00:21:01,601
and fly far away
from this miserable house.

304
00:21:03,004 --> 00:21:05,504
Gyu Min says he seems like a good guy.

305
00:21:06,338 --> 00:21:09,404
Forget about Dad and do what you want.

306
00:21:17,671 --> 00:21:19,371
My mouth is watering.

307
00:21:25,971 --> 00:21:28,771
Aren't you on a hunger strike?

308
00:21:30,704 --> 00:21:33,804
At my age, that could kill me.

309
00:21:35,504 --> 00:21:38,338
How are you going
to oppose Gyu Rim like that?

310
00:21:38,738 --> 00:21:41,738
It's fine. I'm a good actor. Watch.

311
00:21:44,038 --> 00:21:47,338
Don't I look completely worn out?

312
00:21:47,804 --> 00:21:48,871
No.

313
00:21:51,404 --> 00:21:53,438
Hey! Say you ate it.

314
00:22:06,538 --> 00:22:08,671
What's all that barking?

315
00:22:09,538 --> 00:22:13,971
I'm starving myself to death,
and you leave your whole family behind,

316
00:22:14,771 --> 00:22:16,438
just to go dating?

317
00:22:16,904 --> 00:22:19,371
He hasn't had a drop of water
since yesterday.

318
00:22:19,371 --> 00:22:22,338
What will you do if something
happens to him?

319
00:22:23,871 --> 00:22:27,804
While Dad's on a hunger strike,
you're stuffing your face?

320
00:22:28,204 --> 00:22:29,438
Are you out of your mind?

321
00:22:29,804 --> 00:22:31,604
I hated to waste what the kids left.

322
00:22:31,971 --> 00:22:33,338
What a load of nonsense.

323
00:22:33,471 --> 00:22:35,038
As if you'd eat the kids' leftovers.

324
00:22:36,838 --> 00:22:39,371
- Enjoy your meal, Dad.
- What?

325
00:22:41,771 --> 00:22:44,104
What's that supposed to mean?

326
00:22:44,204 --> 00:22:46,938
Does that mean you won't see him anymore?

327
00:22:47,071 --> 00:22:50,038
She means she knows you were eating,
so you can eat in peace.

328
00:22:50,071 --> 00:22:52,271
I told you it was mine!

329
00:22:55,538 --> 00:23:00,871
Starting tomorrow I'll follow you around
so you can't see him,

330
00:23:00,871 --> 00:23:02,038
so keep that in mind.

331
00:23:05,271 --> 00:23:08,138
You're loving this, aren't you?

332
00:23:08,163 --> 00:23:09,330
No.

333
00:23:22,838 --> 00:23:25,504
Mu Jin. Kim Mu Jin!

334
00:23:26,071 --> 00:23:27,538
Did you twist it?

335
00:23:27,957 --> 00:23:30,923
Did a snake bite you?
Why can't you walk all of a sudden?

336
00:23:31,638 --> 00:23:34,471
I don't know. I just can't.

337
00:23:35,871 --> 00:23:38,917
So you're not hurt or anything,
you just can't walk?

338
00:23:39,984 --> 00:23:41,417
You scared me!

339
00:23:41,838 --> 00:23:44,171
Come on, let's try walking anyway.

340
00:23:44,171 --> 00:23:45,738
I told Han Gyu Rim everything.

341
00:23:51,158 --> 00:23:53,491
I took her to my father,

342
00:23:54,504 --> 00:23:56,271
and told her everything.

343
00:23:58,004 --> 00:23:59,938
That I'm not just a part-timer.

344
00:24:01,704 --> 00:24:03,904
That I'd been lying to her all this time.

345
00:24:05,571 --> 00:24:08,204
And that's why you can't walk?

346
00:24:13,890 --> 00:24:15,524
I should've just told her.

347
00:24:17,058 --> 00:24:19,391
I should've told her everything
from the start.

348
00:24:20,271 --> 00:24:21,571
What did she say?

349
00:24:23,238 --> 00:24:24,804
I don't know.

350
00:24:26,371 --> 00:24:28,138
She seemed really angry...

351
00:24:32,938 --> 00:24:35,071
She seemed so angry,

352
00:24:36,171 --> 00:24:38,038
that I couldn't even stop her.

353
00:24:42,070 --> 00:24:43,337
Of course she's angry.

354
00:24:44,304 --> 00:24:46,404
I'd be furious too.

355
00:24:47,438 --> 00:24:49,504
"So this guy's been testing me?"

356
00:24:49,597 --> 00:24:52,971
"No, wait. Was he afraid
that if I knew he was rich,"

357
00:24:52,971 --> 00:24:55,438
"I'd cling to him and never let go?"

358
00:24:55,463 --> 00:24:57,397
"Is that why he lied to me for a year?"

359
00:24:57,422 --> 00:24:59,947
Hey, you know that's not it.

360
00:25:00,371 --> 00:25:02,546
You know that better than anyone.

361
00:25:02,571 --> 00:25:05,204
She could see it that way,
from where she stands.

362
00:25:06,171 --> 00:25:10,338
Her pride is all she has,
and you went and bruised it.

363
00:25:21,104 --> 00:25:23,338
Did you not see this coming
once it was all out?

364
00:25:24,171 --> 00:25:26,671
That's why you kept worrying about it.

365
00:25:33,071 --> 00:25:37,438
If it were me, I'd clap like a seal
and say, "Oh my, this is amazing."

366
00:25:37,538 --> 00:25:39,904
"Mu Jin, I'll love you even more now."

367
00:25:40,804 --> 00:25:42,971
That's how I'd let you back in.

368
00:25:45,238 --> 00:25:47,038
I was ready to take whatever she said,

369
00:25:48,038 --> 00:25:51,704
and let her hit me all she wanted.

370
00:25:56,038 --> 00:25:58,938
What do I do, Jeong Woo? I'm terrified.

371
00:26:00,004 --> 00:26:03,638
What if she just says it's over...

372
00:26:05,171 --> 00:26:07,004
What if she leaves me?

373
00:26:08,271 --> 00:26:10,371
What if she just runs away from me?

374
00:26:18,238 --> 00:26:21,138
She'll leave him, she won't.

375
00:26:22,171 --> 00:26:25,071
She'll leave him, she won't.

376
00:26:27,171 --> 00:26:29,771
She'll leave him.

377
00:26:29,771 --> 00:26:30,904
What?

378
00:26:31,404 --> 00:26:32,771
- She won't.
- She won't?

379
00:26:33,004 --> 00:26:35,271
- She'll leave him.
- Use a proper one.

380
00:26:35,438 --> 00:26:37,104
- Hold on. There's another.
- Yeah.

381
00:26:37,104 --> 00:26:38,179
All right, here we go.

382
00:26:38,204 --> 00:26:39,404
- We've got this.
- Yeah.

383
00:26:39,404 --> 00:26:40,771
- She won't.
- She'll leave me.

384
00:26:40,904 --> 00:26:42,938
She'll leave him, she won't.

385
00:26:43,071 --> 00:26:44,471
- She won't.
- She won't.

386
00:26:44,471 --> 00:26:45,838
She'll leave him, she won't.

387
00:26:45,838 --> 00:26:46,838
- She'll leave him.
- Come on!

388
00:26:46,838 --> 00:26:48,171
You should've started
with "she'll leave him"

389
00:26:48,738 --> 00:26:49,804
You idiot!

390
00:26:58,238 --> 00:27:00,138
That's my fifth coffee.

391
00:27:01,738 --> 00:27:03,704
Seo Hyeon, your chance has come.

392
00:27:04,204 --> 00:27:05,504
Yeah, right.

393
00:27:06,371 --> 00:27:09,004
You said big news and good news.
What is it?

394
00:27:09,104 --> 00:27:10,438
Mu Jin,

395
00:27:12,171 --> 00:27:14,104
might break up with Gyu Rim.

396
00:27:16,904 --> 00:27:18,304
Want some water?

397
00:27:22,371 --> 00:27:24,638
Really? Why all of a sudden?

398
00:27:24,704 --> 00:27:27,038
Because our Mu Jin spilled everything.

399
00:27:27,238 --> 00:27:30,271
"The truth is, I'm a rich man's son."

400
00:27:30,638 --> 00:27:31,684
And?

401
00:27:32,504 --> 00:27:34,303
Did Han Gyu Rim say she's leaving him?

402
00:27:34,328 --> 00:27:35,595
Not yet.

403
00:27:36,171 --> 00:27:39,538
She was so shocked
she left without a word.

404
00:27:41,338 --> 00:27:44,004
Left from where? Where'd he tell her?

405
00:27:44,571 --> 00:27:47,204
In front of his father's grave.
That's where he told her the truth.

406
00:27:47,338 --> 00:27:49,504
He introduced her to his father too.

407
00:27:49,529 --> 00:27:51,729
He took her all the way to the grave?

408
00:27:53,404 --> 00:27:54,538
Yeah.

409
00:27:55,304 --> 00:27:57,538
And what were you doing?

410
00:27:57,624 --> 00:28:00,791
Why didn't you stop things
between Kim Mu Jin and Han Gyu Rim?

411
00:28:00,850 --> 00:28:02,984
You said you could make her fall for you!

412
00:28:03,638 --> 00:28:05,204
Well, the thing is...

413
00:28:05,904 --> 00:28:09,271
She's admirably devoted to one man,
just like someone I know.

414
00:28:14,638 --> 00:28:17,504
Get a little more handsome,

415
00:28:19,671 --> 00:28:21,638
or a little less.

416
00:28:22,204 --> 00:28:23,538
Look who's talking.

417
00:28:23,538 --> 00:28:26,038
And what were you doing
instead of winning Kim Mu Jin over?

418
00:28:26,063 --> 00:28:29,167
He won't even glance
at anyone but Han Gyu Rim.

419
00:28:29,192 --> 00:28:30,571
All brains, no sense.

420
00:28:30,571 --> 00:28:33,938
You don't know how to use your looks.

421
00:28:34,771 --> 00:28:37,804
Talk about the pot calling the kettle...

422
00:28:59,571 --> 00:29:01,226
Would you get up, please?

423
00:29:07,371 --> 00:29:12,138
Stop pretending to sleep and give up
your seat if it's not too much trouble.

424
00:29:15,904 --> 00:29:18,538
If you were my sister,
you'd have gotten a smack.

425
00:29:24,138 --> 00:29:25,838
Is this seat yours?

426
00:29:26,938 --> 00:29:31,171
That's not it. All these seniors
are standing here uncomfortably,

427
00:29:31,171 --> 00:29:34,204
so would you give up your seat
when you're not even really asleep?

428
00:29:34,229 --> 00:29:35,729
No, thank you.

429
00:29:35,871 --> 00:29:38,371
This isn't a priority seat.
It's a regular one.

430
00:29:38,497 --> 00:29:41,785
My ankle hurts and I want to sit.
Is that a crime?

431
00:29:41,877 --> 00:29:45,044
No, it's not. It isn't.

432
00:29:45,604 --> 00:29:48,604
But thinking of your own grandparents,

433
00:29:48,604 --> 00:29:51,838
giving up your seat
would bring you good fortune.

434
00:29:53,538 --> 00:29:55,333
I don't need good fortune.

435
00:29:55,358 --> 00:29:57,358
And I don't have any grandparents.

436
00:29:57,671 --> 00:29:59,913
Forcing someone to yield is violence too.

437
00:29:59,938 --> 00:30:01,771
If you want a seat given up that badly,

438
00:30:01,771 --> 00:30:05,097
then grab an empty seat yourself
and give that one up.

439
00:30:05,122 --> 00:30:08,222
Right. My mistake.

440
00:30:08,656 --> 00:30:10,563
I should've kept my mouth shut...

441
00:30:10,588 --> 00:30:12,854
Sit right there and enjoy the ride.

442
00:30:16,738 --> 00:30:21,671
No wonder your ankle hurts,
wearing shoes like those.

443
00:30:22,704 --> 00:30:24,038
This guy, seriously.

444
00:30:24,104 --> 00:30:26,871
What do you care what I wear?

445
00:30:26,871 --> 00:30:28,538
Unbelievable.

446
00:30:28,671 --> 00:30:32,471
The world's really gone mad.

447
00:30:34,304 --> 00:30:37,371
I pity those shoes.

448
00:30:52,604 --> 00:30:56,571
What? Is he following me?

449
00:31:19,265 --> 00:31:20,273
Miss,

450
00:31:21,561 --> 00:31:22,928
Miss, are you all right?

451
00:31:23,188 --> 00:31:24,348
Try getting up.

452
00:31:27,381 --> 00:31:28,394
Are you okay?

453
00:31:29,008 --> 00:31:30,914
Why are you chasing me like that?

454
00:31:31,281 --> 00:31:34,061
What? Me? When?

455
00:31:34,268 --> 00:31:35,807
You're following me on purpose
to get back at me,

456
00:31:35,935 --> 00:31:37,981
for what I said on the bus.

457
00:31:38,100 --> 00:31:39,247
Get back at you?

458
00:31:40,174 --> 00:31:41,267
If you keep following me,

459
00:31:41,321 --> 00:31:42,401
I'll scream.

460
00:31:45,994 --> 00:31:47,708
Do you live alone around here?

461
00:31:48,188 --> 00:31:49,568
I live around here too.

462
00:31:49,781 --> 00:31:51,068
Should I show you my ID?

463
00:31:51,621 --> 00:31:54,448
Look, see?

464
00:31:56,861 --> 00:31:58,688
What do you take me for?

465
00:32:04,168 --> 00:32:05,288
The heel's completely broken.

466
00:32:07,161 --> 00:32:09,392
Mind if I give you a hand?

467
00:32:09,540 --> 00:32:10,928
I'm good at this. Let me see it.

468
00:32:12,114 --> 00:32:13,568
That's badly bent.

469
00:32:14,921 --> 00:32:15,941
Hold on.

470
00:32:22,674 --> 00:32:23,894
Stuck on nice and tight.

471
00:32:25,895 --> 00:32:27,269
Good as new, right?

472
00:32:27,443 --> 00:32:28,494
Here.

473
00:32:30,748 --> 00:32:32,341
You've got to be kidding!

474
00:32:32,827 --> 00:32:36,099
It's nothing. Wasn't much of a skill.

475
00:32:36,143 --> 00:32:39,610
Do you know what these shoes cost?
And you scuffed and scraped them.

476
00:32:39,907 --> 00:32:42,292
What are you going to do? Pay for them!

477
00:32:42,874 --> 00:32:46,208
I do you a favor, and this is what I get?

478
00:32:46,687 --> 00:32:49,883
I fixed them, so you should be paying me
and thanking me,

479
00:32:49,908 --> 00:32:51,401
When did I ask you to fix it?

480
00:32:51,735 --> 00:32:53,497
You took my shoe and ruined it.

481
00:32:53,581 --> 00:32:57,055
And if you hadn't come after me
like that in the first place,

482
00:32:57,323 --> 00:32:58,895
why would I have fallen running away?

483
00:32:59,593 --> 00:33:02,214
This is so upsetting.

484
00:33:03,300 --> 00:33:05,333
What's this now?

485
00:33:06,788 --> 00:33:09,390
I'm the one who wants to cry.

486
00:33:10,164 --> 00:33:11,541
Fine, I'll pay for them.

487
00:33:11,667 --> 00:33:13,486
I'll pay you and that'll be that.

488
00:33:15,355 --> 00:33:17,081
Don't cry. Hold on a second.

489
00:33:26,528 --> 00:33:27,964
Go on, check it.

490
00:33:37,107 --> 00:33:39,220
You could just transfer it by phone.

491
00:33:40,581 --> 00:33:41,594
Or can't you?

492
00:33:42,007 --> 00:33:44,421
- Never done it?
- I know how.

493
00:33:45,381 --> 00:33:49,201
You treat me like
I'm from another century.

494
00:33:51,747 --> 00:33:52,903
Here.

495
00:33:53,350 --> 00:33:54,960
Wear them or don't.

496
00:33:56,374 --> 00:33:57,428
Forget it.

497
00:34:01,541 --> 00:34:02,981
Nasty little thing.

498
00:34:03,006 --> 00:34:05,853
Hope her foot gives out
before she gets far.

499
00:34:07,067 --> 00:34:08,886
I'll just give these to my mother.

500
00:34:28,354 --> 00:34:32,716
(If no one's waiting at home to feed you,
or if you're hungry, eat your fill.)

501
00:34:32,741 --> 00:34:35,094
(No charge.)

502
00:34:36,961 --> 00:34:38,441
You startled me.

503
00:34:38,782 --> 00:34:39,930
Would you like some help?

504
00:34:41,121 --> 00:34:42,510
Yes.

505
00:34:49,881 --> 00:34:51,548
That's very kind of you.

506
00:34:52,155 --> 00:34:54,127
Are you a student?

507
00:34:55,207 --> 00:34:56,448
Yes.

508
00:35:03,014 --> 00:35:04,675
What can I get you?

509
00:35:05,059 --> 00:35:08,520
One order each of spicy rice cakes,
blood sausage, and fritters to go, please.

510
00:35:09,314 --> 00:35:10,692
How do you want the blood sausage?

511
00:35:10,903 --> 00:35:13,217
And which fritters?

512
00:35:13,828 --> 00:35:15,343
Just blood sausage and liver, please.

513
00:35:15,368 --> 00:35:17,288
And a mix of whatever for the fritters.

514
00:35:17,713 --> 00:35:20,595
I've sliced the blood sausage
and warmed the fritters,

515
00:35:20,846 --> 00:35:23,904
so eat whatever you like while you wait.

516
00:35:24,060 --> 00:35:27,811
As a thank-you for taping up my sign,

517
00:35:28,365 --> 00:35:29,740
it's on the house.

518
00:35:30,574 --> 00:35:31,788
Thank you.

519
00:35:37,993 --> 00:35:40,458
Dig in properly, why don't you.

520
00:35:41,000 --> 00:35:43,800
Our signature dish,

521
00:35:43,903 --> 00:35:46,195
try the fish cakes first.

522
00:35:46,416 --> 00:35:48,721
It'll knock you off your feet.

523
00:35:51,320 --> 00:35:52,347
Go on.

524
00:35:54,188 --> 00:35:55,214
Thank you.

525
00:35:59,787 --> 00:36:01,388
Well? Good, isn't it?

526
00:36:03,492 --> 00:36:05,601
The spicy rice cakes here are the best.

527
00:36:05,627 --> 00:36:07,396
- That's enough for you.
- Su Nam.

528
00:36:07,421 --> 00:36:08,692
Hui Na, you're here?

529
00:36:08,694 --> 00:36:09,719
- Hello.
- Hello.

530
00:36:09,721 --> 00:36:10,728
Your shadow's here too.

531
00:36:11,280 --> 00:36:12,445
Let me serve you.

532
00:36:14,467 --> 00:36:15,511
Wait.

533
00:36:17,098 --> 00:36:18,117
It's you, isn't it?

534
00:36:18,142 --> 00:36:21,042
From about a year ago.

535
00:36:21,181 --> 00:36:22,308
You know him?

536
00:36:25,106 --> 00:36:26,320
Sort of...

537
00:36:28,986 --> 00:36:31,519
I'll transfer your pay
for the part-time work.

538
00:36:31,558 --> 00:36:32,950
Just give me your account number.

539
00:36:33,861 --> 00:36:35,874
No need. I wasn't after the money.

540
00:36:37,741 --> 00:36:39,720
Part-time job? What part-time job?

541
00:36:42,017 --> 00:36:43,234
It's a long story.

542
00:36:44,254 --> 00:36:45,847
I'm going to run to the restroom,

543
00:36:45,874 --> 00:36:47,776
so watch the stall for me, Hui Na.

544
00:36:47,801 --> 00:36:50,205
Is that the one where you slipped
on the wet floor last time?

545
00:36:50,230 --> 00:36:51,253
That's the one.

546
00:36:51,255 --> 00:36:53,445
I'll come with you.
What if you fall again?

547
00:36:53,826 --> 00:36:56,888
- No need.
- Let's go together.

548
00:36:57,608 --> 00:36:59,937
- Watch the stall for me.
- Sure.

549
00:36:59,962 --> 00:37:00,980
Let's go.

550
00:37:01,005 --> 00:37:04,659
Eat all you want while we're gone.

551
00:37:04,794 --> 00:37:05,814
All right.

552
00:37:26,301 --> 00:37:28,498
Hey, baby.

553
00:37:29,273 --> 00:37:30,328
You're up?

554
00:37:31,113 --> 00:37:34,520
I was going to wake you,
but you looked too peaceful.

555
00:37:36,082 --> 00:37:37,507
Say around seven?

556
00:37:38,329 --> 00:37:39,730
I'll pick you up tomorrow.

557
00:37:40,597 --> 00:37:41,964
Me too.

558
00:37:44,026 --> 00:37:45,308
Love you.

559
00:37:51,127 --> 00:37:52,146
What are you looking at?

560
00:37:58,021 --> 00:38:01,248
Here you go. Enjoy, and come again.

561
00:38:01,273 --> 00:38:02,286
Thank you.

562
00:38:09,007 --> 00:38:10,986
You really won't take the money?

563
00:38:12,660 --> 00:38:14,169
I hope business goes well, ma'am.

564
00:38:14,894 --> 00:38:16,974
I told you, it's free.

565
00:38:17,773 --> 00:38:19,161
Who is he, really?

566
00:38:21,788 --> 00:38:23,984
A very stubborn part-timer.

567
00:38:43,292 --> 00:38:46,512
(Mu Jin)

568
00:38:51,587 --> 00:38:55,132
I'm sorry. I never lied
with bad intentions.

569
00:38:55,760 --> 00:38:57,493
I swear on my father.

570
00:38:58,054 --> 00:39:00,148
You're not sick, are you?
Nothing's happened?

571
00:39:01,140 --> 00:39:04,500
I'm worried, so if you're okay,
just send me a dot.

572
00:39:16,941 --> 00:39:18,216
Ms. Han Gyu Rim.

573
00:39:21,121 --> 00:39:22,166
Who are you?

574
00:39:22,967 --> 00:39:24,514
I'm Chairwoman Hong Ok Seon's secretary.

575
00:39:25,454 --> 00:39:27,491
And who is Chairwoman Hong Ok Seon?

576
00:39:28,701 --> 00:39:30,853
She's Mu Jin's mother.

577
00:39:31,354 --> 00:39:34,697
The chairwoman would like
a moment of your time.

578
00:39:37,286 --> 00:39:38,874
I have a shift to get to.

579
00:39:39,146 --> 00:39:41,593
The restaurant has already been notified.

580
00:39:58,013 --> 00:40:00,909
Did you visit Chairman Kim's grave today?

581
00:40:02,008 --> 00:40:03,032
Yes.

582
00:40:03,599 --> 00:40:06,580
I paid my respects
at Mu Jin's father's grave.

583
00:40:07,628 --> 00:40:08,842
Let's go.

584
00:40:49,401 --> 00:40:50,622
Thank you.

585
00:41:09,524 --> 00:41:11,804
(Chairwoman Hong Ok Seon)

586
00:41:19,301 --> 00:41:21,099
Is something wrong with Gyu Rim?

587
00:41:21,599 --> 00:41:22,747
Is she sick?

588
00:41:22,900 --> 00:41:27,829
She's been late before,
but never once missed a shift.

589
00:41:50,040 --> 00:41:52,339
She's not home right now.

590
00:41:52,440 --> 00:41:53,900
She went to work.

591
00:41:54,421 --> 00:41:55,427
She did?

592
00:42:05,145 --> 00:42:06,438
(Gyu Rim)

593
00:42:07,268 --> 00:42:11,248
The number you have dialed is unavailable.
Please leave a message after the tone...

594
00:42:14,967 --> 00:42:16,001
Thanks.

595
00:42:18,605 --> 00:42:19,669
Come in.

596
00:42:19,694 --> 00:42:21,683
Welcome.

597
00:42:21,976 --> 00:42:23,961
Hello. It's been a while.

598
00:42:23,986 --> 00:42:26,009
Yes, it has.

599
00:42:26,034 --> 00:42:28,249
I called Hun Tae to have a meal,

600
00:42:28,274 --> 00:42:31,341
and he said he wouldn't eat
with another woman while he has a wife.

601
00:42:31,367 --> 00:42:32,661
There she goes again.

602
00:42:32,686 --> 00:42:33,712
Hey, Chairwoman Hong.

603
00:42:33,948 --> 00:42:36,292
I've been asking you to have a meal
with us for years,

604
00:42:36,317 --> 00:42:38,667
and you never came,
and now here you are out of the blue.

605
00:42:38,692 --> 00:42:40,027
Glad you made it.

606
00:42:40,052 --> 00:42:42,077
I made spicy braised pork ribs.

607
00:42:42,102 --> 00:42:43,571
You're okay with spicy, right?

608
00:42:43,664 --> 00:42:45,741
It's my favorite.

609
00:42:46,541 --> 00:42:48,448
I've been stressed lately,

610
00:42:48,508 --> 00:42:50,694
and craving something spicy. Thank you.

611
00:42:51,254 --> 00:42:55,104
I finally get to taste the cooking
I've heard so much about.

612
00:42:56,309 --> 00:42:58,048
Don't spread it around too much.

613
00:42:58,247 --> 00:42:59,888
It's a hassle when people come calling.

614
00:43:01,474 --> 00:43:04,606
You must be starving.
It's well past dinnertime.

615
00:43:04,631 --> 00:43:05,714
Come, sit down.

616
00:43:33,514 --> 00:43:35,034
- You're really enjoying it.
- It's delicious.

617
00:43:36,920 --> 00:43:40,240
I hear you don't even use a housekeeper.

618
00:43:41,080 --> 00:43:46,202
No, I like feeding and clothing
my family with my own hands.

619
00:43:46,960 --> 00:43:49,047
I do hire someone for the cleaning.

620
00:43:49,072 --> 00:43:50,309
You'll give yourself indigestion.

621
00:43:50,323 --> 00:43:52,007
No one's taking it from you. Slow down.

622
00:43:53,013 --> 00:43:54,931
It doesn't taste the same if I go slow.

623
00:43:56,851 --> 00:44:00,287
Your wife's cooking is unbelievable.

624
00:44:00,323 --> 00:44:02,746
- Isn't it?
- Of everything I've ever eaten,

625
00:44:02,771 --> 00:44:04,293
this is the best. Truly.

626
00:44:06,448 --> 00:44:09,161
Let me invest so you can open
a restaurant. Please?

627
00:44:09,683 --> 00:44:12,040
It's not that good.

628
00:44:12,820 --> 00:44:14,120
You two talk.

629
00:44:14,187 --> 00:44:16,021
- Let me know if you need anything.
- Sure.

630
00:44:16,698 --> 00:44:18,706
Don't be like that. Eat with us.

631
00:44:19,014 --> 00:44:22,082
I went to a lot of trouble
for this wine. Have some.

632
00:44:22,208 --> 00:44:24,914
I'm completely taken with you.

633
00:44:24,928 --> 00:44:26,156
I want us to be close.

634
00:44:26,181 --> 00:44:28,200
Yes, come have a glass of wine with us.

635
00:44:28,225 --> 00:44:29,238
Sit down, come on.

636
00:44:29,448 --> 00:44:30,547
Shall I, then?

637
00:44:31,100 --> 00:44:32,473
Have a seat.

638
00:44:33,295 --> 00:44:34,341
What?

639
00:44:35,213 --> 00:44:37,224
Mu Jin has another woman?

640
00:44:39,100 --> 00:44:40,981
Then where does that leave Seo Hyeon?

641
00:44:41,266 --> 00:44:44,416
She doesn't compare to Seo Hyeon at all.

642
00:44:45,219 --> 00:44:48,322
Of all people, how could he pick
someone so far beneath him...

643
00:44:48,347 --> 00:44:50,557
He's lost his mind.

644
00:44:51,720 --> 00:44:54,684
Still, your son must see
something good in her,

645
00:44:54,709 --> 00:44:57,209
or he wouldn't be with her.

646
00:44:57,234 --> 00:44:58,357
Something good?

647
00:44:58,668 --> 00:45:04,139
I had Secretary Cha
look into her background,

648
00:45:04,440 --> 00:45:06,441
and she's from a dirt-poor family,

649
00:45:06,466 --> 00:45:08,908
single father, siblings one after another,

650
00:45:09,004 --> 00:45:11,254
and she never even went to college.

651
00:45:11,754 --> 00:45:13,501
Who knows what she was up to,

652
00:45:13,522 --> 00:45:16,207
but she couldn't even get into college
when just about anyone can.

653
00:45:16,393 --> 00:45:19,072
And Seo Hyeon lost out
to a girl like that?

654
00:45:19,461 --> 00:45:20,867
My pride is wounded.

655
00:45:21,082 --> 00:45:23,075
Is Mu Jin that bad a judge of character?

656
00:45:23,100 --> 00:45:24,324
Does he know nothing about women?

657
00:45:24,807 --> 00:45:25,834
Honey...

658
00:45:29,055 --> 00:45:31,369
How did he meet her?

659
00:45:31,394 --> 00:45:35,668
She works part-time at the restaurant
where he's learning the business.

660
00:45:36,568 --> 00:45:40,243
Secretary Cha says she may not know
who Mu Jin really is,

661
00:45:40,268 --> 00:45:42,747
but no, she knows everything.

662
00:45:42,788 --> 00:45:43,949
She thinks she's hit the jackpot,

663
00:45:43,974 --> 00:45:45,403
and she's latched onto him like a leech,

664
00:45:45,405 --> 00:45:48,440
draining him dry, that girl.

665
00:45:48,521 --> 00:45:49,839
She must be a gold digger.

666
00:45:50,223 --> 00:45:52,377
That's right, a gold digger.
Of course she is.

667
00:45:52,402 --> 00:45:54,064
- Honey.
- What?

668
00:45:54,279 --> 00:45:56,793
This isn't like you.

669
00:45:57,561 --> 00:45:58,840
I'm upset, that's why.

670
00:45:59,600 --> 00:46:02,715
What could Seo Hyeon
possibly be lacking...

671
00:46:03,563 --> 00:46:04,607
Forget it.

672
00:46:04,794 --> 00:46:07,878
Tell him I wouldn't take a man like Mu Jin
if you delivered him by the truckload.

673
00:46:09,316 --> 00:46:11,541
Really, now. Are you drunk?

674
00:46:11,543 --> 00:46:13,121
Don't you worry.

675
00:46:13,407 --> 00:46:14,907
I'll take care of all of it.

676
00:46:15,641 --> 00:46:17,840
How could I ever accept a girl
that far beneath us,

677
00:46:17,881 --> 00:46:19,654
as my daughter-in-law?

678
00:46:20,427 --> 00:46:23,021
Do you know who I am? Hong Ok Seon.

679
00:46:23,148 --> 00:46:25,921
Not if the sky splits in two.
Not a chance.

680
00:46:27,734 --> 00:46:29,681
I'll make some hangover soup.

681
00:46:29,860 --> 00:46:31,894
Let's be in-laws.

682
00:46:32,114 --> 00:46:33,255
What?

683
00:46:33,280 --> 00:46:35,685
Who said anything about that?
I told you no.

684
00:46:35,807 --> 00:46:37,964
Not even by the truckload, I said.

685
00:46:37,989 --> 00:46:41,404
Not you, Hun Tae. I mean
I want to be in-laws with Yun Hui.

686
00:46:41,648 --> 00:46:44,808
I'm completely smitten with you today.

687
00:46:45,347 --> 00:46:47,556
My mother used to say,

688
00:46:47,614 --> 00:46:51,178
a woman who cooks food this fine and warm,

689
00:46:51,203 --> 00:46:54,710
the daughter she raises
is worth taking sight unseen.

690
00:46:54,987 --> 00:46:56,027
Enough of that.

691
00:46:56,052 --> 00:46:57,905
Thank you for thinking so well of me.

692
00:46:57,930 --> 00:46:59,618
You. Out.

693
00:47:00,081 --> 00:47:01,834
You upset me tonight. Finished eating?

694
00:47:01,868 --> 00:47:04,426
- Go home, now.
- Honey, really.

695
00:47:04,493 --> 00:47:07,573
Please give me Seo Hyeon.

696
00:47:07,715 --> 00:47:12,049
They grew up together, so he just
doesn't see her as a woman yet.

697
00:47:12,288 --> 00:47:14,483
Mu Jin will come to his senses.

698
00:47:15,260 --> 00:47:17,220
I said no, Chairwoman Hong.

699
00:47:17,689 --> 00:47:20,547
I'm the one saying no.
I have my pride too.

700
00:47:21,040 --> 00:47:22,828
We are never being in-laws.

701
00:47:23,134 --> 00:47:26,136
- Seriously.
- Cheers.

702
00:47:26,161 --> 00:47:27,761
- Cheers.
- Not with you.

703
00:47:27,807 --> 00:47:30,004
Cheers, Yun Hui. Cheers.

704
00:47:30,188 --> 00:47:31,891
So what are you going to do?

705
00:47:48,387 --> 00:47:49,822
Where's the chairwoman?

706
00:47:50,216 --> 00:47:53,221
Something urgent came up,
so she had to go.

707
00:47:54,368 --> 00:47:57,041
Wasn't it the chairwoman
who asked to see me?

708
00:47:57,066 --> 00:47:58,433
Well...

709
00:47:58,846 --> 00:48:01,427
After further consideration,

710
00:48:01,781 --> 00:48:06,431
she felt there was little need or value
in meeting you face to face.

711
00:48:20,007 --> 00:48:21,187
What is this?

712
00:48:22,921 --> 00:48:24,041
A hundred thousand dollars.

713
00:48:26,787 --> 00:48:28,152
Is this how she tells me
to break up with Mu Jin?

714
00:48:28,154 --> 00:48:31,085
So cheaply and cruelly?

715
00:48:33,961 --> 00:48:36,398
We can offer more if it's not enough.

716
00:48:40,414 --> 00:48:41,548
Make it a hundred million dollars.

717
00:48:44,033 --> 00:48:45,967
Did you say a hundred million dollars?

718
00:48:46,028 --> 00:48:49,537
You're asking me to put a price
on how I feel about Mu Jin.

719
00:48:49,958 --> 00:48:51,007
So make it a hundred million dollars.

720
00:48:51,554 --> 00:48:52,674
Ms. Han Gyu Rim.

721
00:48:52,755 --> 00:48:55,814
I may be bad at school,
but I can add and subtract.

722
00:48:56,255 --> 00:48:57,755
Anything less is out of the question.

723
00:48:58,135 --> 00:48:59,141
Hand over a hundred million dollars.

724
00:48:59,521 --> 00:49:00,901
Then I'll break up with him for you.

725
00:49:12,538 --> 00:49:15,878
(Gyu Rim)

726
00:49:20,187 --> 00:49:21,320
Where are you?

727
00:49:21,978 --> 00:49:23,842
Are you trying to drive me crazy?

728
00:49:23,867 --> 00:49:25,227
I'm hungry.

729
00:49:25,507 --> 00:49:27,247
I'm starving to death.

730
00:49:59,601 --> 00:50:00,881
Gyu Rim.

731
00:50:03,814 --> 00:50:06,260
You're here? Sit.

732
00:50:07,214 --> 00:50:08,894
You haven't eaten either, right?

733
00:50:09,348 --> 00:50:11,087
I'll order more meat.

734
00:50:14,141 --> 00:50:15,284
Want a drink too?

735
00:50:17,168 --> 00:50:18,497
What happened?

736
00:50:20,194 --> 00:50:21,547
Where have you been all this time?

737
00:50:22,721 --> 00:50:23,947
I needed to think.

738
00:50:24,514 --> 00:50:27,028
But I'm done thinking now.

739
00:50:28,461 --> 00:50:31,741
To be with you,
I need to build up my stamina first.

740
00:50:32,234 --> 00:50:34,359
To weather a typhoon,

741
00:50:34,967 --> 00:50:37,554
ordinary stamina won't cut it.

742
00:50:45,448 --> 00:50:46,948
Does that mean you forgive me?

743
00:50:49,534 --> 00:50:50,554
Yes.

744
00:50:54,214 --> 00:50:56,147
You must have had your reasons.

745
00:50:57,255 --> 00:50:58,947
I understand why you did it.

746
00:51:02,107 --> 00:51:04,168
Even if we do break up someday,

747
00:51:04,589 --> 00:51:05,674
it's not now.

748
00:51:06,308 --> 00:51:08,454
Why would we ever break up?

749
00:51:09,014 --> 00:51:11,141
That won't happen
as long as you don't leave.

750
00:51:15,834 --> 00:51:16,847
All right.

751
00:51:18,447 --> 00:51:21,780
I spent all day thinking
you'd want to end it...

752
00:51:23,708 --> 00:51:25,134
You didn't answer your phone,

753
00:51:25,168 --> 00:51:26,726
you didn't come to work,

754
00:51:27,260 --> 00:51:29,351
I went to your place
thinking you were sick,

755
00:51:30,323 --> 00:51:32,846
and Gyu Min said you'd gone to work.

756
00:51:34,141 --> 00:51:36,184
I thought something had really happened,

757
00:51:36,186 --> 00:51:38,129
and I was on edge all day...

758
00:51:40,381 --> 00:51:41,665
I'm sorry.

759
00:51:42,363 --> 00:51:44,759
I'm sorry for worrying you.

760
00:51:46,114 --> 00:51:48,348
Do you know how scared I was?

761
00:51:54,448 --> 00:51:56,096
Mu Jin.

762
00:51:59,527 --> 00:52:02,344
Why are you acting like a child?
People are watching.

763
00:52:03,431 --> 00:52:04,760
I'm sorry.

764
00:52:17,647 --> 00:52:21,880
I'm sorry for worrying you.

765
00:52:34,767 --> 00:52:36,560
Excuse me, how long is the wait?

766
00:53:00,433 --> 00:53:02,547
I told you he was with a woman.
Hyeon Su, I mean.

767
00:53:03,040 --> 00:53:05,426
If you don't believe me,
go see for yourself.

768
00:53:12,873 --> 00:53:14,192
Hui Na,

769
00:53:14,640 --> 00:53:17,468
I'm at a funeral right now,
so I can't really talk...

770
00:53:18,548 --> 00:53:19,834
Is something wrong?

771
00:53:30,834 --> 00:53:32,367
Hey, Park Hyeon Su!

772
00:53:34,182 --> 00:53:35,854
Does this look like a funeral to you?

773
00:53:37,454 --> 00:53:38,792
Hui Na.

774
00:53:40,161 --> 00:53:42,287
It is pretty hip, though.

775
00:53:42,446 --> 00:53:44,361
Didn't you say your great-aunt died?

776
00:53:44,861 --> 00:53:46,624
Since I'm here, let me pay my respects.

777
00:53:46,701 --> 00:53:50,154
Hui Na, here's the thing...

778
00:53:50,988 --> 00:53:52,282
What happened was,

779
00:53:52,390 --> 00:53:54,854
my great-aunt nearly died,
and then miraculously...

780
00:53:54,856 --> 00:53:56,074
Hey, Park Hyeon Su!

781
00:54:00,709 --> 00:54:01,746
Chae Hui.

782
00:54:01,940 --> 00:54:02,967
Who are you?

783
00:54:03,668 --> 00:54:05,194
Who are you?

784
00:54:07,554 --> 00:54:09,531
Is this the great-aunt?

785
00:54:10,123 --> 00:54:11,178
What?

786
00:54:12,652 --> 00:54:15,029
Hey, Park Hyeon Su, you answer.

787
00:54:15,470 --> 00:54:16,480
Who is she?

788
00:54:16,908 --> 00:54:17,914
What?

789
00:54:21,347 --> 00:54:24,539
Calculating which one to dump?

790
00:54:24,880 --> 00:54:26,674
What are you talking about?

791
00:54:26,781 --> 00:54:29,573
- So here's what happened...
- Save it!

792
00:54:30,698 --> 00:54:32,810
I'm dumping you first.

793
00:54:34,147 --> 00:54:35,922
Now you don't have to sneak around.

794
00:54:36,158 --> 00:54:38,889
This woman, that woman, some other woman!

795
00:54:39,191 --> 00:54:40,548
See them all you want.

796
00:54:43,666 --> 00:54:46,782
- Chae Hui, just hear me out.
- You bastard!

797
00:54:56,480 --> 00:54:58,850
Hey, Kwon Hui Na, you!

798
00:54:59,574 --> 00:55:00,603
Hey.

799
00:55:00,925 --> 00:55:03,255
- Hey!
- Let go!

800
00:55:04,067 --> 00:55:06,581
Feels good making a fool out of me?

801
00:55:08,532 --> 00:55:09,653
Does it?

802
00:55:09,678 --> 00:55:12,885
Be grateful I'm ending it here.

803
00:55:12,910 --> 00:55:14,720
You piece of garbage.

804
00:55:17,047 --> 00:55:19,117
Why, you...

805
00:55:21,400 --> 00:55:23,564
What is it, punk?

806
00:55:23,838 --> 00:55:25,561
- Give me the 50 dollars.
- What?

807
00:55:27,107 --> 00:55:28,222
What 50 dollars?

808
00:55:28,247 --> 00:55:30,634
At the spicy rice cake stall earlier,

809
00:55:31,768 --> 00:55:34,455
you took 50 dollars from the cash box
and stuffed it in your pocket.

810
00:55:37,248 --> 00:55:40,466
- When did I?
- While she was in the restroom.

811
00:55:40,681 --> 00:55:41,727
Seriously,

812
00:55:43,907 --> 00:55:46,142
you stole from Su Nam?

813
00:55:52,020 --> 00:55:53,399
Let go.

814
00:56:13,315 --> 00:56:14,401
Are you all right?

815
00:56:20,694 --> 00:56:21,990
You always catch me,

816
00:56:24,253 --> 00:56:26,937
at my most embarrassing.

817
00:56:27,100 --> 00:56:29,709
My memory's bad, so I'll forget soon.

818
00:56:30,966 --> 00:56:32,402
Don't worry about it.

819
00:56:50,901 --> 00:56:51,941
Why?

820
00:56:52,921 --> 00:56:54,540
Mom's waiting for you.

821
00:57:09,314 --> 00:57:10,660
That girl,

822
00:57:11,781 --> 00:57:14,214
you took her to your father's grave?

823
00:57:15,548 --> 00:57:16,574
Yes.

824
00:57:18,568 --> 00:57:19,770
I thought you were just,

825
00:57:19,795 --> 00:57:22,029
having fun and would end it soon.

826
00:57:22,576 --> 00:57:24,024
You were serious?

827
00:57:25,188 --> 00:57:26,214
Yes.

828
00:57:28,921 --> 00:57:29,931
Then I suppose,

829
00:57:30,031 --> 00:57:32,575
you won't end it just because I say so?

830
00:57:33,881 --> 00:57:34,892
No.

831
00:57:35,240 --> 00:57:37,921
No matter what you say, I can't leave her.

832
00:57:43,320 --> 00:57:44,668
But what am I to do?

833
00:57:46,887 --> 00:57:49,785
I could never accept that girl.

834
00:57:50,813 --> 00:57:53,319
She's the woman I'll live with, not you.

835
00:57:53,561 --> 00:57:54,574
Is that so?

836
00:57:56,028 --> 00:57:57,389
Then choose.

837
00:57:58,667 --> 00:58:02,148
Give up everything
you enjoy because of me,

838
00:58:02,662 --> 00:58:04,916
or give up that girl.

839
00:58:06,899 --> 00:58:08,155
Which will it be?

840
00:58:10,734 --> 00:58:11,743
All right,

841
00:58:12,390 --> 00:58:13,755
I'll give it all back.

842
00:58:14,048 --> 00:58:15,382
Everything I got from you.

843
00:58:18,788 --> 00:58:19,800
Fine.

844
00:58:20,588 --> 00:58:21,594
Fine, then.

845
00:58:22,474 --> 00:58:25,400
Every share, every property, every cash
you had for being my son,

846
00:58:25,402 --> 00:58:27,247
down to the last pair of socks.

847
00:58:28,101 --> 00:58:29,651
And walk out with nothing.

848
00:58:32,614 --> 00:58:33,643
All right,

849
00:58:34,858 --> 00:58:36,014
I'll do that.

850
00:58:55,434 --> 00:58:56,624
Mu Jin.

851
00:59:35,381 --> 00:59:38,666
Mom, Mu Jin is actually packing!

852
00:59:38,668 --> 00:59:41,241
Nothing in this house
was bought with his own money!

853
00:59:41,266 --> 00:59:43,058
Tell him to walk out empty-handed!

854
00:59:44,280 --> 00:59:45,624
Mom.

855
01:00:05,854 --> 01:00:06,872
Kim Mu Jin,

856
01:00:08,880 --> 01:00:10,534
this feeling is temporary.

857
01:00:10,600 --> 01:00:13,326
It's not worth giving up everything,

858
01:00:13,447 --> 01:00:15,154
and staking your whole life on.

859
01:00:16,941 --> 01:00:18,331
Take care of Mom for me.

860
01:00:19,034 --> 01:00:20,052
Mu Jin,

861
01:00:20,640 --> 01:00:22,747
I went through all this myself.

862
01:00:23,014 --> 01:00:24,072
And?

863
01:00:24,833 --> 01:00:25,921
Do you regret it?

864
01:00:29,354 --> 01:00:30,361
I don't.

865
01:00:30,528 --> 01:00:32,254
If I let Gyu Rim go like this,

866
01:00:32,761 --> 01:00:34,228
I think I'd regret it my whole life.

867
01:00:38,240 --> 01:00:39,287
Hey,

868
01:00:39,907 --> 01:00:41,204
Kim Mu Jin!

869
01:01:05,025 --> 01:01:11,111
(I protect my daughter!
Hunger strike, day one!)

870
01:01:35,721 --> 01:01:37,012
Mom,

871
01:01:38,513 --> 01:01:40,058
what do I do?

872
01:01:41,900 --> 01:01:43,310
I'm scared.

873
01:01:44,627 --> 01:01:46,369
I'm so terribly scared.

874
01:01:53,644 --> 01:01:55,451
(Mu Jin)

875
01:02:14,148 --> 01:02:15,168
Hello?

876
01:02:16,381 --> 01:02:17,394
Were you asleep?

877
01:02:17,828 --> 01:02:19,390
No, I just lay down.

878
01:02:19,931 --> 01:02:21,002
What about you?

879
01:02:22,643 --> 01:02:23,661
Are you outside?

880
01:02:24,628 --> 01:02:26,058
I couldn't sleep,

881
01:02:26,675 --> 01:02:28,278
so I came out for a walk.

882
01:02:37,327 --> 01:02:38,510
Gyu Rim.

883
01:02:39,641 --> 01:02:40,654
Yes.

884
01:02:43,448 --> 01:02:45,154
No matter what happens from now on,

885
01:02:46,535 --> 01:02:48,074
don't give up on me.

886
01:02:52,906 --> 01:02:53,920
I won't.

887
01:02:56,161 --> 01:02:57,183
Good.

888
01:02:58,411 --> 01:02:59,790
That's all I needed.

889
01:03:04,228 --> 01:03:06,688
I love you, Mu Jin.

890
01:03:12,294 --> 01:03:13,536
Gyu Rim, do you know,

891
01:03:14,970 --> 01:03:16,868
that's the first time
you've told me you love me?

892
01:03:18,454 --> 01:03:19,461
Is it?

893
01:03:20,121 --> 01:03:21,128
It is.

894
01:03:22,789 --> 01:03:24,156
That's all I needed.

895
01:03:25,774 --> 01:03:28,814
That alone made my whole day.

896
01:03:31,840 --> 01:03:36,053
I love you too, Han Gyu Rim. Sleep well.

897
01:03:37,286 --> 01:03:38,482
Good night.

898
01:04:38,207 --> 01:04:40,433
(Danger! Falling hazard)

899
01:04:40,933 --> 01:04:42,879
Look out!

900
01:05:25,516 --> 01:05:28,436
(Love on the Menu)

901
01:05:28,461 --> 01:05:31,127
How badly is he hurt?

902
01:05:31,152 --> 01:05:32,814
It's not life-threatening, is it?

903
01:05:32,816 --> 01:05:35,901
Ms. Han Gyu Rim,
what do you know about Mu Jin?

904
01:05:35,903 --> 01:05:37,581
You had no idea at all?

905
01:05:37,606 --> 01:05:40,750
He gave up everything for you.

906
01:05:40,834 --> 01:05:43,398
- We've lost the house.
- What do you mean?

907
01:05:43,434 --> 01:05:46,274
- Let's just each fend for ourselves.
- Then what about Gyu Min and Gyu Seo?

908
01:05:46,276 --> 01:05:48,483
I say we drop them at an orphanage.

909
01:05:48,485 --> 01:05:49,954
Shut your mouth, Han Gyu Yeong.

910
01:05:50,088 --> 01:05:52,247
Have a lovely life together without me.

911
01:05:52,402 --> 01:05:53,661
Just give me the hundred thousand.

912
01:05:53,663 --> 01:05:57,841
A hundred thousand dollars to walk away
from Mu Jin sounds like a fair deal.

913
01:05:58,671 --> 01:06:00,571
Dramaday.me
